0..78 Comment "// A case runs one of its arms, so each arm acts on an endpoint from where the"
79..96 Comment "// case found it."
97..99 Comment "//"
100..174 Comment "// An offer\'s arms already act on an endpoint this way. A case is the same"
175..225 Comment "// choice, made by a value instead of by the peer."
226..228 Comment "//"
229..308 Comment "// Every arm leaves each endpoint as the first arm leaves it. The endpoint then"
309..366 Comment "// stands at one state after the case, whichever arm ran."
367..369 Comment "//"
370..385 Comment "// - see: #4707"
